  "name": "gitops-helm-chart",
  "description": "Installs or upgrades a third-party Helm chart (cert-manager, ingress-nginx, external-dns, an operator) on a cluster by adding it to the GitOps repository in the form the repository's reconciler already syncs: an Argo CD Application, a Flux HelmRelease, a Config Sync RootSync, or kustomize helmCharts. Opens one pull request through submit-suggestion, pins the chart version, and carries or names everything the chart needs outside the cluster. Never runs helm. Use when a request asks to install, add, deploy, or upgrade a chart or a packaged third-party component. Don't use for kube-agents itself (an operator upgrades it with the installer), plain workload YAML (use gke-manifest-generation), or Google Cloud resources (use gcp-config-connector, or gcp-terraform on a Terraform repository).",
